                 "source": "default",
diff --git a/doc/lightningd-config.5.md b/doc/lightningd-config.5.md
index ae97c8ec4..830e27b2a 100644
--- a/doc/lightningd-config.5.md
+++ b/doc/lightningd-config.5.md
@@ -721,6 +721,14 @@ all DNS lookups, to avoid leaking information.
 
   Disable the DNS bootstrapping mechanism to find a node by its node ID.
 
+* **allow-peers-without-networks**
+
+  Keep a peer whose `init` message names no `networks`. On a chain that
+shares its genesis block with another (the Bitcoin BLAKE2b chain shares
+Bitcoin's), such a peer is dropped by default, since nothing before
+`open_channel` says which chain it follows and LND never sent the field.
+Has no effect on a chain whose `chain_hash` is its genesis.
+
 * **message-padding**=*BOOL*
 
   If set to `true`, `connectd` will send extra bytes to peers to make messages
